    "detailed_description": "Frog isn't just another low effort clicker game, We're committed to creating an experience that the community loves. We regularly add new features and frogs based on community feedback, ensuring that the game continues to evolve and stay exciting. Frog is built to stay for the long run!<br><br>Every 2 hours, you can get a random frog with different rarities to grow your collection. Here\u2019s what you can expect:<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Big variety of fancy frogs<br></li><li> A welcoming community <br></li><li> Shop<br></li><li> Collection<br></li><li> Crafting<br></li><li> Visable Inventory in-game<br></li><li> Rankings and Leaderboard<br></li><li> Multiplayer Lobbys<br></li><li> Exciting events<br></li><li> Design submission via our discord! All Frogs are made with community effort and inspiration, come join the fun!</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features to be added in near future:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Trade ups<br></li><li>And more!</li></ul>",
